   "title": "TUC Rejects FG’s N70,000 Transport Allowance, Demands Salary Increase",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/29/tuc-rejects-fgs-n70000-transport-allowance-demands-salary-increase/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
