   "summary": "“We are working on the 2027 budget, and we intend to present it before the end of the year,” Uzoka-Anite said. The planned presentation is expected to set the stage for the National Assembly’s consideration of the proposed budget ahead of the 2027 fiscal year. The annual budget outlines the Federal Government’s spending priorities, revenue projections and economic objectives for the coming year.",
   "summary_zh": "“我们正在制定2027年预算，并计划在年底前提交，”Uzoka-Anite说。预计此次提交将为国民议会审议拟议预算铺平道路，以便在2027财年到来前完成相关程序。年度预算列明联邦政府来年的支出重点、收入预测和经济目标。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Minister of State for Budget, Dr Doris Nkiruka Uzoka-Anite, disclosed this on Wednesday while briefing State House correspondents after the Federal Executive Council (FEC) meeting presided over by President Bola Tinubu at the Presidential Villa, Abuja. “We are working on the 2027 budget, and we intend to present it before the end of the year,” Uzoka-Anite said. The planned presentation is expected to set the stage for the National Assembly’s consideration of the proposed budget ahead of the 2027 fiscal year. The annual budget outlines the Federal Government’s spending priorities, revenue projections and economic objectives for the coming year. We’ve got the edge. Get real-time reports, breaking scoops, and exclusive angles delivered straight to your phone. Don’t settle for stale news. Join LEADERSHIP NEWS on WhatsApp for 24/7 updates →",
