   "title": "JUST IN: FG Approves N70,000 Monthly Transport Allowance For Workers",
   "url": "https://leadership.ng/just-in-fg-approves-n70000-monthly-transport-allowance-for-workers/",
   "domain": "leadership.ng",
   "source": "Leadership（尼日利亚）",
