   "summary": "Dangote Petroleum Refinery and Petrochemicals is set to become the first industrial facility to deploy Honeywell Technologies’ newly launched artificial intelligence platform, with the technology projected to generate more than $60 million in annual gross operational benefits at full refining capacity. The platform, known as Forge Plant Cognition, combines Honeywell’s process engineering expertise with NVIDIA’s […]",
   "summary_zh": "Dangote Petroleum Refinery and Petrochemicals即将成为首家部署Honeywell Technologies新推出人工智能平台的工业设施。该技术预计在炼油产能全部投产时，每年可为运营带来超过$60 million的毛收益。该平台名为Forge Plant Cognition，将Honeywell的工艺工程专长与NVIDIA的 […] 相结合。",
